USE OF DOWNLOADED MATERIAL

Mediary is a tool for downloading and organising publicly accessible media.
Public accessibility does not automatically grant permission to reuse media.

Mediary does not determine, infer or certify the licensing status of anything
it downloads. Determining whether you have the right to download, store or
reuse a given piece of media - and complying with the terms of service of the
site it came from and with applicable copyright law - is solely the
responsibility of the person using this software.
